<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.house.wakes ~ hoala ~ hoʻāla, the host shim walks it

hoʻāla stands and wakes containers, so the host shim walks it (`tools/lares-container.sh rite hoala`): run `lares rite hoala` on the host with LAR_ROOT unset, and the shim answers it. No CLI row plans it; reached by the CLI inside a house, the door refuses `usage` and names the shim.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ wake

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`wake` params=`~ on the host, with LAR_ROOT unset, the shim walks it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ the host shim stands containers; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

